    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "l3sMC",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -1372,
      "name": "登录页 · 浅色",
      "context": "独立登录页，1080 正方形。背景为 asset/blue-hour-air.glsl，保留 AIR 椭圆布局与漂移。通过标量场柔化后查询首页 blue-hour-palette.png，保持五色过渡，不直接混合深浅 RGB。底部 70%—93% 在同一色表内渐变至冰蓝，独立浅色蒙层停用。静态颗粒 0.003。表单及排版不变，速度 0 可暂停。详见 asset/blue-hour-air.md。 作为居中登录面板：圆角32、1.5px内描边及柔和投影；主页在面板外模糊，面板本身保持清晰。",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1080,
      "height": 1080,
      "fill": "#FFFFFF",
      "cornerRadius": 32,
      "stroke": {
        "type": "gradient",
        "gradientType": "linear",
        "enabled": true,
        "rotation": 180,
        "size": {
          "height": 1
        },
        "colors": [
          {
            "color": "#FFFFFFA6",
            "position": 0
          },
          {
            "color": "#FFFFFF4D",
            "position": 0.5
          },
          {
            "color": "#465A9F40",
            "position": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeAlignment": "inner",
      "effect": [
        {
          "type": "shadow",
          "shadowType": "outer",
          "color": "#11173333",
          "offset": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 24
          },
          "blur": 64,
          "spread": -12
        },
        {
          "type": "shadow",
          "shadowType": "outer",
          "color": "#11173314",
          "offset": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 4
          },
          "blur": 12
        }
      ],
      "layout": "none",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "A2eqQj",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "背景渐变 · Blue hour AIR",
          "context": "AIR 椭圆场缓慢漂移。先混合与柔化色表坐标，再查首页同一张 Oklab 五色色表；不直接混合深浅 RGB。页脚提亮内置于 Shader。",
          "width": 1080,
